{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":56,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["外族人蒙拯救"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「你們要堅持正義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"秉行公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的救恩快要來臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公義快要彰顯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謹守而不褻瀆安息日、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不做惡事的人有福了！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"歸信耶和華的外族人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要以為耶和華會把你和祂的子民分開。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"太監也不要說自己只是一棵枯樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「如果太監遵守我的安息日、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做我喜悅的事、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"持守我的約，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我的殿中和牆內賜給他們紀念碑和名號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們勝過有兒女的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必賜給他們永遠不會被除去的名號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於那些歸信耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事奉祂、愛祂的名、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做祂僕人的外族人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是謹守而不褻瀆安息日、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"持守祂約的人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必領他們到我的聖山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在向我禱告的殿內使他們歡欣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們獻在我祭壇上的燔祭和其他祭物必蒙悅納，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的殿必稱為萬民禱告的殿。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"招聚以色列流亡者的主耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「除了這些被招聚回來的人以外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我還要招聚其他人。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列昏庸的首領"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"田野和林中的一切走獸啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來吞吃吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的守望者都瞎眼無知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是不會叫的啞巴狗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只喜歡躺下睡覺做夢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些人就像貪吃的狗，不知飽足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像什麼都不懂的牧人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人各行其是，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追求自己的利益。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說：「來吧，我去拿酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們喝個痛快！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明天會跟今天一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至更豐盛。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/56.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/57.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/55.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}